### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 72/100.** Evidence TB2.1 56.4 ; GDPVal 1448 ; Tau V3 avg 70.9; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 72/100.** Evidence GPQA 87 ; RULER 94.7 ; HLE 26.7; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 92/100.** 1M (262K default serve) — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 20/100.** Text in/out (beyond text unverified); scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 74/100.** Evidence SWE 71.9 ; LiveCode 89%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 100/100.** Free trial $0/$0 (NVIDIA trial).
- **Overall Score: 66/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (72+72+92+20+74)/5=66.0 → 66; best-fit per scoring methodology.

